---
// Turns the step-by-step figures (```steps) of a page into players. The server
// draws each as a plain list of its steps (StepsFigure.tsx), so without script
// a reader still gets every step in order. Rendered only on a site whose notes
// use one (usesSteps), so every other site ships none of this. The player is
// the same code the app runs (@onden/markdown stepsEnhance.ts), fetched as a
// script of the site itself.
---

<script>
  if (document.querySelector(".md-steps[data-steps]")) {
    void import("@onden/markdown/steps-enhance").then((m) => m.installStepsPlayers(document));
  }
</script>
